<div class="grid">
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Welcome to the CMS</h2>
    <p class="muted">Use the left menu to manage content. This interface is a lightweight CMS admin for your portfolio backend.</p>

    <p style="margin-top:16px" class="muted">Signed in as <strong><%= current_admin&.email || 'Unknown' %></strong></p>

    <h3 style="margin-top:18px">Quick actions</h3>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
      <div style="flex:1 1 200px;min-width:180px" class="card">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px">Create Project</h4>
        <div class="small">Add a new portfolio project from the API or future CMS form.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px"><a class="primary" href="<%= admin_new_project_path %>">Create</a></div>
      </div>

      <div style="flex:1 1 200px;min-width:180px" class="card">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px">View Contact Messages</h4>
        <div class="small">Check messages sent from the site contact form.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px"><a class="primary" href="<%= admin_resource_path('contact_messages') %>">Open</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="actionResult" style="margin-top:14px"><pre id="resultPre">Server session login active</pre></div>
  </section>

  <aside class="card">
    <h4>Tips</h4>
    <ul class="small">
      <li>Keep your token private — this page stores it in localStorage for convenience.</li>
      <li>Use the <strong>Copy Authorization header</strong> to paste into API clients ("Authorization: ******;token&gt;").</li>
      <li>Logout clears the stored token and returns to the login page.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 style="margin-top:12px">Mobile friendly</h4>
    <p class="small">Layout collapses to a single column on small screens. Buttons are large enough for touch.</p>
  </aside>
</div>
